### 게시글 관련 API (Articles)

#### 게시글 등록
POST http://localhost:5050/articles
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "title" : "제목4",
    "content" : "내용4"
}

#### 게시글 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/articles/3

#### 게시글 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/articles?offset=0&search=&orderBy=asc

#### 게시글 수정
PUT http://localhost:5050/articles/3
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "title" : "수정된 제목",
    "content" : "수정된 내용"
}

#### 게시글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:5050/articles/3

---

### 댓글 관련 API (ArticleComments)

#### 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:5050/articles/3/comments
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "content" : "댓글 내용"
}

#### 댓글 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/articles/3/comments

#### 댓글 수정
PUT http://localhost:5050/articles/3/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "content" : "수정된 댓글 내용"
}

#### 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:5050/articles/3/comments/1

---

### 상품 관련 API (Products)

#### 상품 등록
POST http://localhost:5050/products
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "name" : "상품명",
    "description" : "상품 설명",
    "price" : 10000,
    "tags" : ["tag1", "tag2"]
}

#### 상품 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/products/5

#### 상품 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/products?offset=0&search=&orderBy=asc

#### 상품 수정
PUT http://localhost:5050/products/5
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "name" : "수정된 상품명",
    "description" : "수정된 상품 설명",
    "price" : 12000,
    "tags" : ["tag3", "tag4"]
}

#### 상품 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:5050/products/5

---

### 상품 댓글 관련 API (ProductComments)

#### 상품 댓글 등록
POST http://localhost:5050/products/5/comments
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "content" : "상품 댓글 내용"
}

#### 상품 댓글 조회
GET http://localhost:5050/products/5/comments

#### 상품 댓글 수정
PUT http://localhost:5050/products/5/comments/1
Content-Type: application/json
{
    "content" : "수정된 상품 댓글 내용"
}

#### 상품 댓글 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:5050/products/5/comments/1
